QnALog — notice and attribution
===============================

QnALog is an Obsidian plugin that records and transcribes conversations and
turns them into structured Markdown knowledge.

Origin
------

This project is derived from LexVoice, an Obsidian plugin by Lynnx, and is
based on its last MIT-licensed release: tag 2.1.2, commit d924e439
(https://github.com/Lynn-x/LexVoice). It is an independent project, not a
continuation of that repository's release line.

